/E (Agriculture is one of the most important sectors contributing to the economy and livelihood of rural communities. Farmers play a major role in food production and maintaining the agricultural balance of society. However, increasing environmental issues, excessive use of chemical fertilizers, soil degradation, water scarcity, and climate change have created serious challenges in the agricultural sector. These challenges highlight the importance of adopting sustainable farming practices that can protect the environment while improving agricultural productivity and farmer well-being.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
